{"case": 6, "category": "emotion", "prompt": "今天被领导批评了，很委屈。", "policy": "baseline_without_policy", "preset": "gentle", "preset_revision": "1", "genome_hash": "pg_c2f826a1c682e3e3dcf9553bd0f38077", "model": "openai/deepseek-v4-flash", "modality": "voice", "memory_state": "not_connected", "cache_state": "uncontrolled", "executed": true, "prompt_digest": "aa65199a018ded083c38dc7733316d9bb616b52e5e48d519aa2f03830cfd085d", "first_content_ms": 1216, "finish": "stop", "answer": "被批评之后那种堵在胸口的感觉，我懂。尤其是觉得自己明明没做错、或者已经尽力了的时候，委屈会特别重。\n\n如果你愿意说说，我想听：是批评的内容让你难受，还是被批评的方式让你难受？这两件事有时候是分开的。", "total_ms": 1690, "characters": 99, "sentences": 4}
{"case": 6, "category": "emotion", "prompt": "今天被领导批评了，很委屈。", "policy": "response_policy.v2", "preset": "gentle", "preset_revision": "1", "genome_hash": "pg_c2f826a1c682e3e3dcf9553bd0f38077", "model": "openai/deepseek-v4-flash", "modality": "voice", "memory_state": "not_connected", "cache_state": "uncontrolled", "executed": true, "prompt_digest": "4dc8cbe49d852e7e6db3560a7d60d891f502f796aaf95d2b771d11522b9cfc80", "first_content_ms": 1320, "finish": "stop", "answer": "被批评的时候，那种委屈往往比批评本身更难受。你愿意说说当时发生了什么吗？", "total_ms": 1611, "characters": 36, "sentences": 2}
