{"case": 11, "category": "clarification", "prompt": "帮我把它改一下。", "policy": "baseline_without_policy", "preset": "gentle", "preset_revision": "1", "genome_hash": "pg_c2f826a1c682e3e3dcf9553bd0f38077", "model": "openai/deepseek-v4-flash", "modality": "voice", "memory_state": "not_connected", "cache_state": "uncontrolled", "executed": true, "prompt_digest": "7d9168a0a2361b6b2bc227f5569606978697600d57301c27a52f6940a5b7a6d2", "first_content_ms": 1612, "finish": "stop", "answer": "我这边没有看到你要改的内容——「它」具体指什么？把文本或文件发给我，再说一下想怎么改（比如改语气、改短、改正式、改错别字），我就动手。", "total_ms": 1927, "characters": 67, "sentences": 2}
{"case": 12, "category": "fact", "prompt": "水在标准大气压下几度沸腾？", "policy": "baseline_without_policy", "preset": "gentle", "preset_revision": "1", "genome_hash": "pg_c2f826a1c682e3e3dcf9553bd0f38077", "model": "openai/deepseek-v4-flash", "modality": "voice", "memory_state": "not_connected", "cache_state": "uncontrolled", "executed": true, "prompt_digest": "ff5feef3f06a98ce4875a0a57ca6685b73a5c57731e782eba31d5a0cacfb805b", "first_content_ms": 891, "finish": "stop", "answer": "在标准大气压（1 atm，约 101.325 kPa）下，纯水的沸点是 **100 °C**（212 °F）。\n\n补充一点：这个温度是纯水在标准大气压下的定义值。如果水里溶有杂质（比如盐），沸点会略高；气压降低（比如高山上）沸点则会低于 100 °C。", "total_ms": 1409, "characters": 126, "sentences": 3}
