{"case": 14, "category": "brief", "prompt": "一句话解释什么是递归。", "policy": "baseline_without_policy", "preset": "gentle", "preset_revision": "1", "genome_hash": "pg_c2f826a1c682e3e3dcf9553bd0f38077", "model": "openai/deepseek-v4-flash", "modality": "voice", "memory_state": "not_connected", "cache_state": "uncontrolled", "executed": true, "prompt_digest": "70e5ada416b554abe57096fdda6725c0007b63cf4557868c62d345c2d9439653", "first_content_ms": 1216, "finish": "stop", "answer": "递归就是：一个函数在解决问题时，把问题缩小一点后调用它自己，直到小到可以直接得出答案为止。", "total_ms": 1530, "characters": 45, "sentences": 1}
{"case": 14, "category": "brief", "prompt": "一句话解释什么是递归。", "policy": "response_policy.v2", "preset": "gentle", "preset_revision": "1", "genome_hash": "pg_c2f826a1c682e3e3dcf9553bd0f38077", "model": "openai/deepseek-v4-flash", "modality": "voice", "memory_state": "not_connected", "cache_state": "uncontrolled", "executed": true, "prompt_digest": "81a307bd7b580b9a40d76d81c8e1ed2c8645caccd13a4902e4adf593fbd036e6", "first_content_ms": 1252, "finish": "stop", "answer": "递归就是函数自己调用自己，把大问题拆成同样形式的小问题，直到遇到能直接解决的最小情况为止。", "total_ms": 1512, "characters": 45, "sentences": 1}
